WEBVTT

00:00:02.110 --> 00:00:03.530
I'm home!

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:05.660
-Nina!
-Nina!

00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:08.540
I must go to the land of the gods.

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:10.830
I implore your help.

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:15.290
If you are able to embrace
those contradictions too,

00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:18.590
then your love may be real.

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:22.130
It must have been hard.

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:24.970
I can tell from how attached she is.

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:28.680
I can tell how kind you've been to her.

00:00:28.930 --> 00:00:30.600
I'm off, then!

00:01:01.510 --> 00:01:04.090
So there are three tribes absent.

00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:07.100
It has been five years since Cocytus fell.

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:12.680
And we have been driven to this barren land.
Is there no hope for our future?

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:15.350
Even if I should perish,

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:17.400
I will make the humans pay.

00:01:17.480 --> 00:01:19.320
Taking action now would accomplish nothing.

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:24.740
The power the humans wield
is nothing permanent.

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:28.530
Power that is too great for its
master must wane,

00:01:29.160 --> 00:01:31.620
just as it did for Belzebuth ten years ago.

00:01:32.450 --> 00:01:34.370
However, Lucifer,

00:01:34.540 --> 00:01:37.330
I worry our continued survival may be difficult.

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:39.840
If we repeat the failings of the gods,

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:41.750
then that will indeed be our end.

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:45.880
Let us watch and wait.

00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:47.640
It will not be long

00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:50.220
before the perfect opportunity
presents itself to us.

00:01:57.150 --> 00:01:59.650
Let us follow Lucifer's lead.

00:02:01.190 --> 00:02:03.480
If we lack the means to fight mankind,

00:02:03.650 --> 00:02:05.490
then that is the wise choice.

00:02:09.240 --> 00:02:10.990
Incidentally, Lucifer,

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:13.540
have you discerned the whereabouts
of Azazel?

00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:19.420
There has been no word of him
since he stormed off to the human capital on his own.

00:02:19.750 --> 00:02:22.050
I wonder if he is even still alive.

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:53.240
Our next challenger is

00:02:53.410 --> 00:02:58.210
the deadliest killing machine
in Anatae's history!

00:02:58.370 --> 00:03:03.670
The Rag Demon!

00:03:10.130 --> 00:03:11.970
Kill him.

00:03:12.140 --> 00:03:13.510
-Kill him!
-Kill him dead!

00:03:13.680 --> 00:03:14.470
Drop dead!

00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:20.900
Hurry up and kill him!

00:03:21.060 --> 00:03:21.940
Kill him!

00:03:41.420 --> 00:03:43.170
Rage of Bahamut

00:03:43.420 --> 00:03:45.880
They are the same
and lose themselves

00:03:46.050 --> 00:03:54.140
Cuz there are lots of roads to go
And the path suddenly seems rougher

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:59.560
I wanna walk straight ahead
Knock down another dream

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:05.110
Most broke before they ever came true

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:09.150
But walk this way

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:14.240
Get out of my way

00:04:17.540 --> 00:04:22.250
Depends on the way you think it
To a yielding heart

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:26.920
the future, hope,
despair and worry all look all the same

00:04:28.630 --> 00:04:33.220
So much that you'll turn down the truth
that lied to you that day

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:37.930
when you were prepared for it all.
You go your way, don't you?

00:04:38.390 --> 00:04:42.390
But walk this way

00:04:44.020 --> 00:04:47.480
Get out of my way

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:52.530
But walk this way

00:05:30.360 --> 00:05:32.150
This isn't looking good.

00:05:33.440 --> 00:05:37.320
The barrier is stronger than it was before.
I can't get any farther.

00:05:37.530 --> 00:05:38.660
What?

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:41.120
You two will have to go on without me.

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:42.410
What? What do you mean?

00:06:08.770 --> 00:06:10.860
Look, Nina!

00:06:11.150 --> 00:06:12.320
Nina?

00:06:49.350 --> 00:06:50.440
Enter.

00:06:51.020 --> 00:06:53.940
Hi there! Pardon us!

00:06:55.900 --> 00:06:57.110
Mugaro?

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:03.660
He has been this way
since our battle with the humans.

00:07:03.830 --> 00:07:06.080
And I told you so, didn't I?

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:09.000
No one's going to obey if you
do things your way.

00:07:09.210 --> 00:07:11.330
Not him and not the humans.

00:07:11.500 --> 00:07:12.500
Bacchus!

00:07:12.630 --> 00:07:15.670
-I'd like to leave El's care to you.
-What now?

00:07:15.840 --> 00:07:20.130
Yes, of course! We would be happy to do
anything for you.

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:21.550
No way!

00:07:21.760 --> 00:07:23.050
Don't try to push this on me!

00:07:23.220 --> 00:07:24.930
-Bacchus!
-Shut up!

00:07:25.100 --> 00:07:26.560
I'm not babysitting a—

00:07:26.720 --> 00:07:27.930
If you do this,

00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:30.520
I shall reward you with wine.

00:07:30.640 --> 00:07:32.310
Yes, I'll do it!

00:07:33.980 --> 00:07:35.320
I leave it to you.

00:07:35.480 --> 00:07:37.280
Yes, ma'am!

00:07:39.990 --> 00:07:41.320
El!

00:07:41.490 --> 00:07:43.570
Do you remember me?

00:07:47.910 --> 00:07:49.620
Let's have fun again.

00:07:57.510 --> 00:08:00.300
It's huge! Jeanne!

00:08:02.890 --> 00:08:05.680
Oh, that's right. You're scared of spiders.

00:08:24.870 --> 00:08:27.700
So this is what the land of the gods is like.

00:08:27.870 --> 00:08:29.660
Oh, Jeanne!

00:08:29.830 --> 00:08:32.160
There are some tasty looking berries!

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:39.670
You shouldn't eat them without—

00:08:39.840 --> 00:08:41.760
They're so pretty! Time for a taste!

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:42.630
Hey!

00:08:44.140 --> 00:08:46.050
They're so good! What are these?

00:08:47.510 --> 00:08:48.890
You should try one too, Jeanne!

00:09:02.780 --> 00:09:03.990
You are right!

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:05.700
Right?

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:17.920
What a cute angel!

00:09:35.560 --> 00:09:37.770
We are not here to fight.

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:44.990
My name is Jeanne D'Arc.

00:09:45.150 --> 00:09:48.370
I came here riding on the back of an elder dragon

00:09:48.530 --> 00:09:50.280
in search of my son.

00:09:51.240 --> 00:09:52.830
Is that true?

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:54.790
My son's name is El.

00:09:56.080 --> 00:09:58.710
If you know where he is, please share it with me.

00:10:00.920 --> 00:10:02.000
And who are you?

00:10:02.170 --> 00:10:03.880
What? Me?

00:10:04.050 --> 00:10:05.470
I'm....

00:10:06.680 --> 00:10:09.470
I'm his mother too. Yes.

00:10:12.770 --> 00:10:15.480
No? Sorry.

00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:19.440
I'm Jeanne's friend.

00:10:25.030 --> 00:10:26.860
All of you, continue guarding the area.

00:10:27.030 --> 00:10:28.160
Yes, my lady.

00:10:28.320 --> 00:10:29.700
Follow me.

00:10:34.410 --> 00:10:36.540
Is that a god's carriage?

00:10:36.910 --> 00:10:39.080
We're borrowing it from a god named Bacchus.

00:10:39.250 --> 00:10:40.380
Bacchus?

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:41.960
I have never heard of him.

00:10:42.130 --> 00:10:43.420
Is he really a god?

00:10:46.590 --> 00:10:47.680
-Probably.
-Probably.

00:11:05.360 --> 00:11:08.240
What a beautiful place.

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:12.530
But it's a little more plain and empty
than what I imagined.

00:11:12.700 --> 00:11:17.040
I thought the land of the gods would be
way more bright and sparkly.

00:11:22.710 --> 00:11:24.750
There is something I would like to show you.

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:30.630
Did I say something wrong?

00:11:43.440 --> 00:11:45.020
It's so pretty!

00:11:45.190 --> 00:11:46.650
It is magnificent.

00:11:46.820 --> 00:11:50.030
Wow! I've never seen anything like this before!

00:11:50.450 --> 00:11:53.530
These lights represent the gods
who have fallen in battle.

00:11:54.830 --> 00:11:56.450
Not long ago,

00:11:56.620 --> 00:11:58.910
this kingdom was full of life.

00:11:59.080 --> 00:12:01.870
But with Bahamut's return ten years ago,

00:12:02.170 --> 00:12:04.040
many gods were lost.

00:12:06.250 --> 00:12:09.550
The world was saved because of our sacrifice.

00:12:14.510 --> 00:12:17.180
But instead of thanking us,

00:12:17.350 --> 00:12:19.850
you humans tried to purge the gods
from existence!

00:12:20.520 --> 00:12:23.060
Even in our recent battle,

00:12:23.520 --> 00:12:25.560
many more lights were added here.

00:12:26.150 --> 00:12:28.320
The reason there are so few gods here

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:30.570
is partly your fault as well!

00:12:42.210 --> 00:12:44.170
I am sorry.

00:12:53.840 --> 00:12:58.560
Even the gods hate mankind.

00:12:59.180 --> 00:13:02.230
Is that what you really want?

00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:07.110
I just can't understand what you're thinking.

00:13:09.820 --> 00:13:10.860
I can't stand it.

00:13:11.530 --> 00:13:14.200
I can't stand the idea of

00:13:14.990 --> 00:13:16.450
everyone hating you.

00:13:30.500 --> 00:13:32.260
Switch with me.

00:13:40.060 --> 00:13:42.680
Hurry up. Eibos' seal has reached its limit.

00:13:42.850 --> 00:13:46.690
We have long surpassed our limits as well.

00:13:47.650 --> 00:13:49.730
How much longer do you think
it can hold?

00:13:49.900 --> 00:13:54.490
A dimensional rift could open at any moment.

00:13:54.650 --> 00:13:57.240
We must break the seal before then.

00:13:57.610 --> 00:14:00.660
Perhaps we should leave this in heaven's hands.

00:14:03.620 --> 00:14:05.830
My apologies.

00:14:08.580 --> 00:14:11.420
When the time comes, the seal
will be broken,

00:14:11.920 --> 00:14:13.760
and I will have to fire this once again.

00:14:13.920 --> 00:14:15.010
It is too dangerous.

00:14:15.170 --> 00:14:17.050
You will lose more than your left eye
next time.

00:14:17.220 --> 00:14:18.720
Even if I should perish,

00:14:18.890 --> 00:14:21.720
I will not hesitate.

00:14:21.890 --> 00:14:24.310
Is it not the same for you?

00:14:26.060 --> 00:14:28.730
It is better than the end of the world, isn't it?

00:14:29.730 --> 00:14:32.690
How long will your bodies be able to hold?

00:14:32.820 --> 00:14:35.940
We will be sure that they
hold until the right time.

00:14:38.860 --> 00:14:42.620
Young men are always in a hurry to die.

00:14:42.950 --> 00:14:46.290
Rage of Bahamut

00:15:05.930 --> 00:15:09.190
Why am I trying to stay alive?

00:15:17.610 --> 00:15:18.860
Ta-da!

00:15:19.030 --> 00:15:21.490
Okay, El! It's time for dinner!

00:15:21.620 --> 00:15:22.870
Here you go.

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:31.830
Just how long are you going to be pouting?

00:15:33.880 --> 00:15:37.130
Eat. If you don't eat, I'm going to tell your mother.

00:15:40.510 --> 00:15:42.180
-Come on and eat!
-Please stop!

00:15:42.340 --> 00:15:46.640
You shouldn't try to force this on poor Mugaro
when he's feeling so hurt.

00:15:46.810 --> 00:15:48.140
Eat!

00:15:48.890 --> 00:15:50.140
We'll leave it right here.

00:15:50.310 --> 00:15:52.150
If you get hungry, just help yourself.

00:15:52.560 --> 00:15:54.520
You'd better eat.

00:16:03.070 --> 00:16:05.120
Mother.

00:16:51.330 --> 00:16:52.870
You made it out safely.

00:16:53.620 --> 00:16:56.920
Yes, thanks to you and your son.

00:16:57.880 --> 00:16:59.550
I'm so glad.

00:17:00.010 --> 00:17:01.550
It's just....

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:04.680
In exchange, you two have....

00:17:04.840 --> 00:17:06.680
Where is El?

00:17:07.260 --> 00:17:08.720
Do not worry.

00:17:08.890 --> 00:17:10.060
He is here.

00:17:11.140 --> 00:17:13.140
Thank goodness.

00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:16.060
I'm glad he's okay.

00:17:20.070 --> 00:17:23.320
It is good to see you, Jeanne.

00:17:31.500 --> 00:17:34.330
Gods are all so pretty.

00:17:34.960 --> 00:17:36.210
Lady Gabriel,

00:17:36.380 --> 00:17:38.420
please allow me to see El.

00:17:38.590 --> 00:17:41.090
El is currently being confined.

00:17:42.380 --> 00:17:43.420
Why?

00:17:43.590 --> 00:17:46.050
I unlocked El's powers

00:17:46.220 --> 00:17:47.550
and used him for war,

00:17:47.720 --> 00:17:49.640
only to be defeated by mankind.

00:17:49.970 --> 00:17:54.020
Because of this, his heart is no
longer with us.

00:17:54.180 --> 00:17:55.890
Lady Gabriel,

00:17:56.190 --> 00:17:57.730
El is my child.

00:17:58.400 --> 00:18:00.820
I am still a servant of the gods.

00:18:01.230 --> 00:18:03.150
Please allow me to talk to him!

00:18:03.740 --> 00:18:05.860
Thank you, Jeanne.

00:18:06.150 --> 00:18:07.490
Yes.

00:18:07.660 --> 00:18:11.910
You might be able to lead El back to us.

00:18:19.040 --> 00:18:21.840
What's wrong with the little brat?

00:18:22.170 --> 00:18:25.420
I don't know. He suddenly stopped moving.

00:18:27.630 --> 00:18:29.720
It's a little creepy.

00:18:30.390 --> 00:18:31.430
Mother!

00:18:35.180 --> 00:18:36.730
El!

00:18:38.810 --> 00:18:40.520
Mother!

00:18:41.690 --> 00:18:43.530
-Mother!
-El!

00:18:43.780 --> 00:18:45.240
-Mother!
-El!

00:18:45.440 --> 00:18:46.450
Mother!

00:18:46.820 --> 00:18:49.280
Mother!

00:18:51.490 --> 00:18:53.450
Nina!

00:18:54.120 --> 00:18:56.000
You guys were here too?

00:18:56.160 --> 00:18:57.410
Yeah! We were!

00:18:57.660 --> 00:19:00.250
I'm so happy!

00:19:00.420 --> 00:19:02.250
Come here!

00:19:02.420 --> 00:19:04.840
Nina!

00:19:07.840 --> 00:19:11.180
Jeanne!

00:19:11.340 --> 00:19:14.680
Thank goodness! I'm so happy!

00:19:14.850 --> 00:19:16.430
-What about us?
-What about us?

00:19:30.860 --> 00:19:32.910
After I was separated from you,

00:19:33.200 --> 00:19:35.290
I was able to hide among the demon slaves

00:19:35.870 --> 00:19:39.000
without being found by the humans.

00:19:41.210 --> 00:19:42.500
My throat was branded,

00:19:43.250 --> 00:19:45.000
and I was sold off.

00:20:41.940 --> 00:20:44.650
I did just as you told me to

00:20:44.810 --> 00:20:49.570
and followed the first person who helped me.

00:20:50.780 --> 00:20:52.030
That was Azazel?

00:20:52.200 --> 00:20:54.950
You know him?

00:20:55.120 --> 00:20:57.450
I used to a long time ago.

00:20:57.620 --> 00:20:59.660
He's amazing!

00:20:59.830 --> 00:21:03.540
He went out all alone to fight
for the poor demons.

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:05.790
He's actually a good person.

00:21:07.340 --> 00:21:10.800
Mother, please let me out of here.

00:21:10.960 --> 00:21:12.300
Leave to do what?

00:21:12.470 --> 00:21:14.130
I will go back to the surface world.

00:21:15.300 --> 00:21:16.470
It is too dangerous.

00:21:16.850 --> 00:21:19.510
I was able to get you back.

00:21:19.680 --> 00:21:20.850
Now my next duty

00:21:21.020 --> 00:21:23.230
is to bring peace to the world.

00:21:23.980 --> 00:21:26.350
You know what is happening, don't you?

00:21:26.730 --> 00:21:31.190
Someone must right the evils
spreading throughout the world.

00:21:32.900 --> 00:21:36.200
And I have the power to do so.

00:21:36.360 --> 00:21:37.490
Watch your arrogance, El.

00:21:39.660 --> 00:21:42.500
You cannot fulfill your duty in your current state.

00:21:42.660 --> 00:21:45.710
Then why did you make me fight?

00:21:46.750 --> 00:21:48.290
Why did you send me to war?

00:21:52.340 --> 00:21:53.760
Let me out of here.

00:21:53.920 --> 00:21:55.840
The answer remains the same.

00:21:56.010 --> 00:21:57.260
Lady Gabriel—

00:21:57.430 --> 00:22:00.100
Listening to Gabriel will get you nowhere.

00:22:05.310 --> 00:22:07.560
Gabriel cannot save the world.

00:22:08.730 --> 00:22:09.900
The only one who can save it...

00:22:11.860 --> 00:22:13.400
is me.

00:22:22.540 --> 00:22:30.000
As horrible as you are
I can't help but love you

00:22:30.540 --> 00:22:37.800
Even while I waited
That is all I felt

00:22:38.300 --> 00:22:46.020
Ephemeral lovers, both flawed and missing pieces
We have finally become one

00:22:46.310 --> 00:22:53.400
in this miniature garden at the edge of sorrow
Can you hear my heart speaking?

00:22:54.280 --> 00:23:01.660
Ah, I may no longer feel
that I want to go back in time

00:23:02.240 --> 00:23:09.250
But there are feelings, feelings, feelings
I can only feel now

00:23:09.420 --> 00:23:17.420
I want to run away with you, dancing
just like in a fairy tale

00:23:17.670 --> 00:23:25.270
Don't tell me it will only be this once, darling
I am on the same ark

00:23:26.310 --> 00:23:29.690
Sha-ra-ran-la, Sha-ra-ran-la
Yeah

00:23:30.190 --> 00:23:34.230
Sha-ra-ran-la, Sha-ra-ran-la
Cinderella step

00:23:34.400 --> 00:23:37.650
Sha-ra-ran-la, Sha-ra-ran-la
Yeah

00:23:37.860 --> 00:23:41.820
Sha-ra-ran-la, Sha-ra-ran-la
Cinderella step

00:23:41.910 --> 00:23:42.780
Yeah

00:23:47.080 --> 00:23:48.960
-It's Lucifer.
-This is Azazel.

00:23:49.120 --> 00:23:50.540
-We're the Fallen Angel Brothers.

00:23:50.710 --> 00:23:53.380
You seem extremely happy to be
surrounded by so many books.

00:23:54.750 --> 00:23:59.220
Next time on Rage of Bahamut:
Virgin Soul, "City of the Gods, Part 2"

00:23:59.420 --> 00:24:00.720
I'm very happy right now.

00:24:01.380 --> 00:24:03.890
BAHA SOUL!!

00:24:04.180 --> 00:24:08.060
Baha Baha Baha Soul.

00:24:08.640 --> 00:24:10.890
I want you...
to watch next time too.
